# Netlify Redirect Configuration
# This file configures redirects for the South Road Trips website

# 301 Redirect from non-www to www domain (permanent)
# Handles: southroadtrips.com/* -> www.southroadtrips.com/*
http://southroadtrips.com/* https://www.southroadtrips.com/:splat 301!
https://southroadtrips.com/* https://www.southroadtrips.com/:splat 301!

# SPA Routing: Route all requests to index.html for React Router
# Must be last rule, catch all remaining routes
/* /index.html 200
